 "notes": [
  "Starting cards as posted under Starting (8): Endor Operations / Imperial Outpost, Endor, Endor: Bunker, Endor: Landing Platform (Docking Bay), Prepared Defenses, Imperial Decree, Mobilization Points, You Cannot Hide Forever; these count toward the 60.",
  "Three Effects start (Imperial Decree, Mobilization Points, You Cannot Hide Forever) and the post names none as the starting Effect, so starting.effect is left empty.",
  "The section headers 'Locations (Sites) (3)' and 'Locations (Systems) (3)' were mis-parsed as cards and removed; the total is 60.",
  "Endor, its sites, Dagobah, Kessel, Sullust and Vibro Axe dested the Dark Side pages; Dagobah is the Dark Special Edition system.",
  "Posted 'U-3P0' dested U-3PO (Yoo-Threepio); 'Chimera' dested Chimaera; 'Dengar In Punishing 1' dested Dengar In Punishing One; 'Vibro Axe' dested Vibro-Ax (Dark).",
  "Lateral Damage is posted under Interrupts but is an Effect; Oppressive Enforcement and Secret Plans were Effects in 2001.",
  "The strategy mentions Tempest Scout 3 ('Tempest Scout 2,3,4, and 6'), but only Tempest Scout 2, 4 and 6 are in the list."
